# Silver Mountain: full win, derived from the game source (no published walkthrough).
# Random values are fixed by the oracle seed 1234: bell rings = 8 (Hermit, after the brooch),
# safe code = 246 (slot machine), third word = "lead" (the book says the magic place is the high pinnacle).
# Coin budget is exactly 4: troll W (1), troll E (2), troll W again (3, leaves the single "coin"), slot machine (4).
# Boots make you invisible until the hall of tapestries, then a stolen+worn uniform does. The palace is one-way
# (entrance has no west exit): leave by the dungeon door (axe), lit lamp (matches), bread to the rats, push cask.
# The pony ride (apple) + moved rubble is the free way back east; the vine route re-enters via the bell rock.
